Description: Set up drivers, codecs and apps after installing Linux
 Post-install setup for Debian, Ubuntu and Linux Mint (and Fedora and Arch):
 the right NVIDIA driver, media codecs, Flatpak with Flathub, fonts and
 everyday tools, plus curated creative, development and gaming apps. Shows the
 full plan before changing anything, and can export it as a script.
